      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Turn Voice off",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Voice, tap <strong>Settings</strong>, then <strong>Server</strong>, and untick <strong>Voice on</strong>. Nothing is heard or sent until you tick it again.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b956d59d4894121f.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See that Voice is off",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The PTT reads <strong>VOICE OFF</strong>. To connect again, tap <strong>Settings</strong> and tick Voice on.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/98d50944fc60f239.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Save battery instead",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>To stay on the net with less battery, tap <strong>Settings</strong> and tick <strong>Voice on</strong> and <strong>Enable power-saving mode</strong>. It adds some delay.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e7cc5feaaea9ecad.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
